      {
        "t": "mistake",
        "html": "<b>bell</b> (war) is not the <i>bell</i> you ring, and not <i>belle</i> (a beautiful woman, from a different root). A <b>belligerent</b> person is warlike, not musical or pretty. Also, <b>complacent</b> (too pleased with oneself) is not <i>complaisant</i> (eager to please others)."
